{
  "text": " I feel like I'm really, really... ...furtively here. I could go again. What's funny? Maybe it's a long story. Maybe it's good news. Madness doesn't have to be bad. It can be cathartic. She's present. You can hear it. If being present is so great, then maybe madness can be great too. You can't always be both connected to yourself and express yourself calmly to your environment. If you allow yourself to lose control, then you are present. Madness doesn't have to be scary. You can look at it like an escape or a disconnection to reality. At least it's a reality now. That's how she feels. I wouldn't deny it ever. Madness doesn't have to be scary.",
